    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（啊……拉莫姐和莉莉亚，还有……/n　那些经常和拉莫姐一起、会参加工作坊的孩子们！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 502,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "果然莫娜就是可靠。/n真的，还好莫娜来了银河座！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "克蕾娅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，真的真的！/n都觉得以前待在拉莫娜来之前那个银河座的自己像假的一样……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在想想，都不知道那时候怎么撑过来的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们夸我我当然高兴，/n但不是说过了吗，再怎么捧我也不会有东西出来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就算不是我去改变，/n也可能会有更晚加入的人改变这里。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不真正相遇的话，很多事情都不会发生，也不会知道。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "克蕾娅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "拉莫娜好成熟啊。/n我也不再去顶撞老师他们了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "克蕾娅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "虽然也有点怕被解雇……/n但怎么说呢，我觉得应该像拉莫娜那样思考。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "像我？是指什么？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "克蕾娅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我觉得，即使对方想法不同，也得试着互相靠近。/n老师们肯定也有老师们自己的考虑……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这倒也是。或者说，要是莫娜当初不愿意靠近我们，/n我们大概也根本不可能互相理解。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030415018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030415,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，愿意主动靠近对方，是很好的态度！/n信赖关系就是这样一点点培养起来的！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304150180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 30201,
